    <p>
      Nothing in these terms limits rights that the law gives you and that cannot be waived or
      limited by contract. This includes the legal guarantees that consumers have in their
      country of residence, and our liability where the law does not allow it to be excluded.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
